@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 9: Worker Recommendation System (Implemented)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Customer
actor "Serviqo Web/Mobile Client" as Client
actor "Serviqo Express Backend" as Backend
actor "Python Recommendation Service" as RecommendationService
actor "Google Gemini API" as Gemini
database "Serviqo MongoDB" as Database

rectangle "Module 9: Worker Recommendation System" {
  usecase "Request recommendations\nfor owned open job" as RequestRecommendations
  usecase "Analyze service\nrequirements" as AnalyzeRequirements
  usecase "Retrieve eligible\nworker candidates" as RetrieveCandidates
  usecase "Semantically match\nskills and category" as MatchWorkers
  usecase "Rank candidates using\nexplainable features" as RankWorkers
  usecase "Present ranked workers\nand match reasons" as PresentRecommendations
  usecase "View recommended\nworker profile" as ViewWorkerProfile
  usecase "Start a job-related\nconversation with a Worker" as ContactWorker
  usecase "Submit helpful /\nnot-helpful feedback" as SubmitFeedback
  usecase "Use category-specific feedback\nin future ranking" as ImproveRanking
}

Customer -- RequestRecommendations
Customer -- SubmitFeedback
Customer -- ViewWorkerProfile
Customer -- ContactWorker
Client -- RequestRecommendations
Client -- PresentRecommendations
Client -- ViewWorkerProfile
Client -- ContactWorker
Client -- SubmitFeedback

RequestRecommendations ..> AnalyzeRequirements : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> RetrieveCandidates : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> MatchWorkers : <<include>>
MatchWorkers ..> RankWorkers : <<include>>
RequestRecommendations ..> PresentRecommendations : <<include>>
ViewWorkerProfile ..> PresentRecommendations : <<extend>>
ContactWorker ..> PresentRecommendations : <<extend>>
SubmitFeedback ..> ImproveRanking : <<include>>

RequestRecommendations -- Backend
SubmitFeedback -- Backend
ContactWorker -- Backend
RetrieveCandidates -- Database
ImproveRanking -- Database
AnalyzeRequirements -- RecommendationService
MatchWorkers -- RecommendationService
RankWorkers -- RecommendationService
RecommendationService -- Gemini

note right of RankWorkers
The deterministic score combines
service category, skill similarity,
location, experience, rating confidence,
and smoothed customer feedback.
end note

note bottom of RecommendationService
Gemini extracts job skill signals and
provides embeddings for category/skill
phrases. It cannot access MongoDB or
override backend eligibility rules.
end note

note bottom of RequestRecommendations
Recommendations require an authenticated
Customer who owns an open job. Only active,
verified Workers who are eligible to bid
are considered. The Customer explicitly
requests AI processing in the job page.
end note

@enduml
